                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">안전한 미생물 배지 제작 실험을 위해 아래 수칙을 확인하세요.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm text-slate-300">
                <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <input type="checkbox" checked id="chk1" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-400 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                    <div>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-white block mb-0.5">실험복 및 보안경, 실험용 장갑 착용</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">시약 및 세균 감염으로부터 신체를 보호합니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </label>

                <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <input type="checkbox" checked id="chk2" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-400 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                    <div>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-white block mb-0.5">시약 취급 및 화상 주의</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">한천가루 흡입을 방지하고 고압증기멸균기(Autoclave) 고온에 유의합니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </label>

                <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-700/60 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <input type="checkbox" checked id="chk3" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-400 w-4 h-4 rounded">
                    <div>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-white block mb-0.5">실험 후 손 씻기 및 소독 수칙 준수</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">배지 제작 및 균 접종 후 손 소독을 철저히 실시합니다.</span>
                    </div>
                </label>
            </div>

            <button onclick="confirmSafetyCheck()" class="w-full py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-emerald-500 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all transform active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-base"></i>
                <span>실험복 & 안전장구 착용 완료 (실험 시작)</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quiz & Inquiry Modal Overlay -->
    <div id="quiz-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/95 backdrop-blur-lg flex items-center justify-center p-4">
